      "status": "blocked",
      "issues": [
        "- Circular arrangement rule: \"Facing the centre (inward) → their right is clockwise\" and the mnemonic \"IN-CR, OUT-AR\" are incorrect; for inward facing, right is anti-clockwise and left is clockwise, while for outward facing, right is clockwise and left is anti-clockwise (correct mnemonic: \"IN-AR, OUT-CR\"). This error appears in Chunk 2, Chunk 3, and the Summary Table."
      ],
